shadowsun-by-tonic for Debian
-----------------------------

The orig tarball is the source release of the 2nd #demoscene 4k source
compo (2004). It only contains shadowsun.c and the build files for
Windows (compile.sh, shadowsun.dsp, shadowsun.dsw).

The patch 01_adapt_makefile.patch adds a Makefile, which uses pkg-config
and the build flags of dpkg-buildflags (hardening), and the g.h header
included by shadowsun.c. The patch 02_enable_vsync.patch enables the
vertical synchronization.

The executable is installed directly as /usr/bin/shadowsun-by-tonic.

Written by Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>, reviewed by Nicolas HOUDELOT.

